      "values:originalText": "(5) A person who wishes to rely on subsection (3) or (4) in\nproceedings bears an evidential burden in relation to that matter.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A person who wishes to rely on subsection (3) or (4) in\nproceedings bears an evidential burden in relation to that matter.",
