      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The following contracts are excluded subscription contracts:\n\n(a) a lease;\n\n(b) a licence in respect of real property;\n\n(c) a contract of hire-purchase;\n\n(d) a contract for payment in instalments;\n\n(e) a contract for supply of childcare;\n\n(f) a contract for supply by a pre-school or school of tuition at a\npre-school, pre-primary, primary or secondary level;\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nSubscription contracts  Part 3\n\nNo. 64, 2026\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Unfair Trading Practices) Act\n\n(g) a contract of a kind prescribed for the purposes of this\nparagraph.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The following contracts are excluded subscription contracts:\n\n(a) a lease;\n\n(b) a licence in respect of real property;\n\n(c) a contract of hire-purchase;\n\n(d) a contract for payment in instalments;\n\n(e) a contract for supply of childcare;\n\n(f) a contract for supply by a pre-school or school of tuition at a\npre-school, pre-primary, primary or secondary level;\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nSubscription contracts  Part 3\n\nNo. 64, 2026\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Unfair Trading Practices) Act\n\n(g) a contract of a kind prescribed for the purposes of this\nparagraph.",
