    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026-sch-1-sec-48d",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "48D Statement and information that must be disclosed when",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026#sch-1-sec-48d"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "offering goods or services under a subscription contract\nScope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a person (the supplier), in trade or commerce, offers to\nsupply, under a contract, goods or services; and\n\n(b) if the contract were entered, the contract would be a\nsubscription contract.\nRequirement to disclose\n\n(2) The supplier must, when making the offer, disclose, in accordance\nwith subsection (3):\n\n(a) a statement that, if entered, the contract would be a\nsubscription contract; and\n\n(b) information about the matters mentioned in subsection (4).\nNote:\nA pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this\nsubsection.\nManner of disclosure\n\n(3) The statement and information must be disclosed:\n\n(a) if the goods or services are of a kind (if any) prescribed for\nthe purposes of this paragraph—in the manner prescribed for\ngoods or services of that kind; or\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "offering goods or services under a subscription contract\nScope\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) a person (the supplier), in trade or commerce, offers to\nsupply, under a contract, goods or services; and\n\n(b) if the contract were entered, the contract would be a\nsubscription contract.\nRequirement to disclose\n\n(2) The supplier must, when making the offer, disclose, in accordance\nwith subsection (3):\n\n(a) a statement that, if entered, the contract would be a\nsubscription contract; and\n\n(b) information about the matters mentioned in subsection (4).\nNote:\nA pecuniary penalty may be imposed for a contravention of this\nsubsection.\nManner of disclosure\n\n(3) The statement and information must be disclosed:\n\n(a) if the goods or services are of a kind (if any) prescribed for\nthe purposes of this paragraph—in the manner prescribed for\ngoods or services of that kind; or\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026-sch-1-sec-48d-ss-1"
        },
