    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026-sch-1-sec-312",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "312 Application—subscription contracts",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026#sch-1-sec-312"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 48B, 48E and 48F, inserted by the Competition and\nConsumer Amendment (Unfair Trading Practices) Act 2026, apply\nin relation to a contract entered into on or after the commencement\nof Part 3 of Schedule 1 to that Act.\n\n(2) Sections 48B, 48E and 48F do not apply to a contract entered into\nbefore that commencement. However:\n\n(a) if the contract is renewed, extended or otherwise continued\non or after that commencement—sections 48B, 48E and 48F\napply to the contract as renewed, extended or otherwise\ncontinued, on and from the day on which the renewal,\nextension or other continuation takes effect; or\n\n(b) if the contract is varied on or after that commencement and\nparagraph (a) has not already applied in relation to the\ncontract—sections 48B, 48E and 48F apply to the contract as\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Sections 48B, 48E and 48F, inserted by the Competition and\nConsumer Amendment (Unfair Trading Practices) Act 2026, apply\nin relation to a contract entered into on or after the commencement\nof Part 3 of Schedule 1 to that Act.\n\n(2) Sections 48B, 48E and 48F do not apply to a contract entered into\nbefore that commencement. However:\n\n(a) if the contract is renewed, extended or otherwise continued\non or after that commencement—sections 48B, 48E and 48F\napply to the contract as renewed, extended or otherwise\ncontinued, on and from the day on which the renewal,\nextension or other continuation takes effect; or\n\n(b) if the contract is varied on or after that commencement and\nparagraph (a) has not already applied in relation to the\ncontract—sections 48B, 48E and 48F apply to the contract as\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:hasPart": [
