    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026-sch-1-sec-313",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "313 Acquisition of property",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026#sch-1-sec-313"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 28B, 48E and 48F do not apply to the extent that:\n\n(a) the operation of the sections would result in an acquisition of\nproperty from a person otherwise than on just terms; and\n\n(b) the acquisition of property would be invalid because of\nparagraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution.\n\n(2) In this section:\nacquisition of property has the same meaning as in\nparagraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution.\njust terms has the same meaning as in paragraph 51(xxxi) of the\nConstitution.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 1 April 2026\nSenate on 22 June 2026]\n\n(45/26)",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Sections 28B, 48E and 48F do not apply to the extent that:\n\n(a) the operation of the sections would result in an acquisition of\nproperty from a person otherwise than on just terms; and\n\n(b) the acquisition of property would be invalid because of\nparagraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution.\n\n(2) In this section:\nacquisition of property has the same meaning as in\nparagraph 51(xxxi) of the Constitution.\njust terms has the same meaning as in paragraph 51(xxxi) of the\nConstitution.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 1 April 2026\nSenate on 22 June 2026]\n\n(45/26)",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026-sch-1-sec-313-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026-sch-1-sec-313-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e6f1fe4f0f20517d5ec03515c42f1b4df666081532c42075ad2d020cdcf1e295"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026#sch-1-sec-313",
